# Paths excluded from Semgrep scanning.
#
# Keep this list short and justified. Anything added here is code nobody
# reviews again, so it must be either generated output or a genuine
# non-finding that cannot carry an inline `nosemgrep` comment.

# Build and tooling output.
build/
.dart_tool/

# Files served as-is to a web host for App Links / Universal Links
# verification. Not application code.
web_deeplink_files/

# --- Firebase client configuration (generated, and not secret) -------------
#
# Both files are generated by the Firebase console / flutterfire CLI and are
# rewritten on every regeneration, so an inline `nosemgrep` comment would not
# survive -- and google-services.json is JSON, which has no comment syntax at
# all.
#
# The gitleaks rules flag the `AIzaSy...` value in them as a leaked API key.
# It is not one: a Firebase client API key is a public project identifier that
# ships inside every APK and IPA and can be extracted from any installed build.
# Google documents it as public. Access is controlled by Firebase Security
# Rules and App Check, never by keeping this string hidden.
#
# See: https://firebase.google.com/docs/projects/api-keys
android/app/google-services.json
lib/firebase_options.dart
